          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 80 SE             GREAT AND LITTLE HAMPDEN     HONOR END LANE                                                   (PRESTWOOD) 6/45                                              Honor End Farmhouse and                                                   East Cottage (formerly 21.6.55                                           listed as Honor End                                                   Farmhouse) -                                                 II 2 houses.  Late C16, much altered.  Front wing rebuilt mid-late C18 in vitreous headers with red brick dressings, off-set plinth, moulded first floor band course and gauged brick window heads.  Left gable rendered and colourwashed. Old tile roof, brick chimney to left.  2 storeys and attic.  Originally 3 bays, the openings now altered.  Blocked windows to left, 4-pane sashes to centre and upper right.  Half-glazed door to right.  Slightly lower extension to right is of red and vitreous brick to ground floor with later C19 brick above, and has one bay of 4-pane sashes.  Wing to rear, forming L-plan, also rebuilt in brick early C19 with old tile roof, the far gable and central chimney built 1954.  2 storeys, 2 bays of leaded casements, entry in far gable.  Interior of this wing has remains of timber frame, with moulded spine beam in far bay. Listing NGR: SP8621101893"
    }
  ],
